  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Against the backdrop of the unprecedented destruction caused by the ongoing war and the humanitarian catastrophe unfolding in the Gaza Strip, this Initiation Plan enables UNDP/PAPP to provide and scale-up ongoing critical support to emergency response in Gaza. It also allows UNDP/PAPP to generate knowledge that further informs immediate responses on the ground and contributes to evidence-based early recovery planning, while leveraging UNDP&#x2019;s integrator role to bring all relevant partners and sta</narrative>
  </description>
